WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.370 line:78% align:center
What's up everybody? We are in the
JPMorgan Chase offices in London.

00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:06.050 line:78% align:center
We see the views, see the vibes,
but have a great time.

00:00:06.160 --> 00:00:07.140 line:78% align:center
Stay tuned to see what it's like.

00:00:07.160 --> 00:00:12.600 line:78% align:center
Let's go. Tell me this is not the most
beautiful office you've ever seen.

00:00:12.620 --> 00:00:14.770 line:78% align:center
We got trophies, marble floors.

00:00:15.220 --> 00:00:20.400 line:78% align:center
What bros? Gotta be a little bit quiet, but
just know this is where they

00:00:20.420 --> 00:00:22.450 line:78% align:center
make million and billion dollar deals.

00:00:25.850 --> 00:00:28.470 line:78% align:center
Okay, so this is a conference room where
people have meetings and make

00:00:28.490 --> 00:00:30.560 line:78% align:center
really crucial decisions
about the business.

00:00:32.570 --> 00:00:34.780 line:78% align:center
Come with me, we're about to see
the rest of the office.

00:00:34.930 --> 00:00:35.380 line:78% align:center
Let's go.
